description.content:
### Organization Sentiment Scores 

 Returns the daily sentiment scores of a given type for the specified companies over a period of time. The scores of up to 10 companies identified by their Bitvore ID (BvID) can be returned in a single call. The time period requested can be up to one year. The call options are: 
 * BvID - Up to 10 Bitvore ID's of companies to return scores for. 
 * Score - Type of score to return. Options are growth, risk, and sentiment (overall sentiment for a company). 
 * Start - First day of the time series to return. In the format of yyyy-MM-dd, 2019-10-01 for example. 
 * End - Last day of the time series to return. In the format of yyyy-MM-dd, 2019-10-09 for example. 


 The following is an example of using the API to return the growth scores for IBM, BvID b00001ab7, between October 1st and October 7th. 

 ```js
 GET https://api.bitvore.com/v2/corp/sentimentscores?bvIds=b00001ab7&scoreType=growth&startDate=2019-10-01&endDate=2019-10-07&key=xyz123
 ```


 The API response will list the timeline of the returned data series as a range. It will then list the scores per day in that range separately for each company requested. The list of scores for a company will be identified by the company's BvID. An example of a response is as follows: 

 ```js
 {
 	"success": true,
 	"response": {
 		{
 			"timeline": {
 				"start": "2019-10-01",
 				"end": "2019-10-07"
 			},
 			"series": [
 				{
 					"bvId": "b00001ab7",
 					"scores": [
 						0.4936433,
 						0.4936433,
 						0.4936433,
 						0.15462846,
 						0.15462846,
 						0.11870702,
 						0.11870702
 					]
 				}
 			]
 		}
 	}
 }
 ```

